   "text": "It was a routine check-up that would shake Greg Jacobs to the core.\nAt just 52, he felt perfectly healthy and was doing what he did every year; visiting his GP for his annual health check.\nBut after a simple blood test uncovered an aggressive cancer lurking in his prostate, he is now sharing his ordeal as a warning for men across the country, just as new testing guidelines are rolled out to boost ",
